WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
System boundaries. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: Choose what enters the model

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: A system boundary says what is inside the analysis and what crosses it. Changing the boundary changes the accounting.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: If the tire is inside the boundary, include its forces; if outside, label the road contact as an external interaction.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: Boundary sketch

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: A system diagram is a model, not a finished vehicle or proof of roadworthiness.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: Choose what enters the model
